THIRD-PARTY NOTICES

timsrust (MannLabs) — https://github.com/MannLabs/timsrust

The reader for the `analysis.tsf_bin` binary layout in `pytsf/bin.py` and
`capi/tsf_compat.c` was written with reference to, and derives its description
of the line-spectrum block from, the `timsrust-tsf` crate. The code here is a
reimplementation in Python and C, not a copy, and has been modified and
extended (profile spectra, peak widths) relative to the original.

At the time of writing, that repository's top-level LICENSE file contains the
MIT License text reproduced below, while its crate manifests and README state
Apache License 2.0. To satisfy either reading, this notice (a) reproduces the
MIT permission notice in full, as MIT requires, and (b) provides the copyright
attribution, statement of modification, and licence reference that Apache
License 2.0 §4 requires for derivative works. The Apache License 2.0 text is
available at http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0. If MannLabs clarifies
the intended licence, this notice should be updated to match.

